  "details": "Hi, I was working on an avatar earlier and entered the name and preview picture while working on it. \n\nAt some point I moved the picture I was using as preview into another folder in my computer.\n\nOnce I was finished working , I tried to go upload the avatar, but the builder page was stuck on loading forever. I tried reloading the SDK multiple times, but it was always stuck on loading.\n\nUnity threw a FileNotFoundException but I noticed it only 10 minutes later.\n\nCan you please make it so the builder page doesn't stay stuck forever if the picture chosen is missing?\n\nThank you",
